---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="GeoParquet validator">
  <header>
    <h1>GeoParquet validator</h1>
    <p class="center">
      Check a GeoParquet file against the abstract tests of the
      <a href="https://github.com/opengeospatial/geoparquet/pull/304">OGC GeoParquet 2.0 draft</a>,
      without leaving your browser.
    </p>
  </header>

  <main class="validator">
    <p class="sub">
      Files are checked locally and never uploaded. A URL is read with range requests from the browser, so its
      server must allow cross-origin reads: public S3 buckets with CORS (Overture's does), GitHub raw and
      source.coop work. Only the first row groups of a URL are read by default; that is a sample, not a
      conformance pass.
    </p>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="card">
        <div id="drop">Drop a <code>.parquet</code> file here, or click to choose one</div>
        <input id="file" type="file" accept=".parquet" hidden>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <input id="url" type="url" placeholder="https://… or the https form of an s3 object">
        <label class="small">Rows to read: <input id="maxrows" type="number" min="0" step="10000" value="100000"> (0 = all rows)</label>
        <button id="go" class="primary">Check URL</button>
        <div class="examples">
          <button data-url="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/opengeospatial/geoparquet/main/examples/example.parquet">2.0 example file</button>
          <button data-url="https://overturemaps-us-west-2.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/release/2026-08-19.0/theme=buildings/type=building/part-00000-66390f89-3dae-58d7-a8f9-dd8538b7141a-c000.zstd.parquet">Overture buildings (1.1, 515 MB, sampled)</button>
          <button data-url="https://data.source.coop/cholmes/overture/geoparquet-country-quad-2/AD.parquet">source.coop 1.0 file</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="status"></div>
    <div id="result"></div>
    <p class="foot">
      The checker is the Rust command-line tool from
      <a href="https://github.com/geoparquet/geoparquet-testing/pull/6">geoparquet-testing#6</a>, compiled to
      WebAssembly. Verdicts follow the abstract-test text. For GeoParquet 1.0 files the
      <a href="https://planetlabs.github.io/gpq/">gpq validator</a> remains the reference.
    </p>
  </main>
  <script src="/validator/app.js" is:inline></script>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .validator { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; padding: 0 1rem; --pass: #2e7d32; --fail: #c62828; --skip: #757575; --line: #ddd; --card: #f6f6f6; }
  .validator p.sub, .validator p.foot { color: var(--skip); font-size: .95rem; }
  .validator .row { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .validator .card { flex: 1 1 320px; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem; }
  .validator #drop { border: 2px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 2rem 1rem; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; }
  .validator #drop.over { border-color: var(--pass); }
  .validator input[type=url] { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: .5rem; font: inherit; }
  .validator input[type=number] { width: 8em; }
  .validator label.small { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--skip); display: block; margin: .5rem 0; }
  .validator button { font: inherit; padding: .45rem .9rem; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fff; cursor: pointer; }
  .validator button.primary { background: #1565c0; color: #fff; border-color: #1565c0; }
  .validator .examples button { margin: .25rem .25rem 0 0; font-size: .85rem; }
  .validator #status { margin: 1rem 0; min-height: 1.4em; }
  .validator #status.fail { color: var(--fail); }
  .validator table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .9rem; margin-top: .5rem; }
  .validator th, .validator td { text-align: left; padding: .35rem .5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
  .validator td.id { white-space: nowrap; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: .85rem; }
  .validator .pass { color: var(--pass); font-weight: 600; }
  .validator .fail { color: var(--fail); font-weight: 600; }
  .validator .skip { color: var(--skip); }
  .validator h2.class { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 1.25rem 0 .25rem; }
  .validator h2.class span { font-weight: 400; color: var(--skip); }
  .validator .verdict { font-weight: 700; }
  .validator .conformant { color: var(--pass); }
  .validator .nonconformant { color: var(--fail); }
  .validator details { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .validator pre { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: .8rem; background: var(--card); padding: .75rem; border-radius: 6px; overflow: auto; }
</style>
